      "skos:definition": "The handbook's health workforce terms (digital terms are addressed separately). One concept per term, each related to the candidate definitions in twg-candidates.glossary.json. A term becomes 'authored' only when the working group adopts a definition: a person sets `definition` and `status`, citing the change set that decided it in `scopeNote`. Re-running scripts/glossary/build_glossary.py keeps authored terms. Organizations several handbooks name live once in smart-ra's organizations scheme (litlfred/smart-ra#198) and are listed under members; organization terms here carry a foaf:focus to a W3C ORG organization (litlfred/folio-assistant-core#411).",
